The root cause summary:

1. Your sanitizeInput function is converting characters to HTML entities (&quot;, &#x27;, &#x2F;)
2. These entities contain & symbols which are getting stored in localStorage
3. When you retrieve them, they still have the & symbols
4. Your PDF code is displaying them as-is

The fix is to stop over-escaping during storage. Only escape when displaying in HTML, never when storing in the database/localStorage.
